      <p class="lede">Punch in your social handles and business links. EyeSpyR scrapes the entire web for every review tied to your name. Verifies your credentials. Generates a live Trust Badge. Updates automatically. Free with every monthly territory lock…</p>
<section id="trust-engine-in-canada-the-local-search-problem">
<h2>Trust Engine in Canada: the local search problem</h2>
<p>EyeSpyR pulls reviews from Google, HomeAdvisor, Houzz, Yelp, Facebook, and BBB on a daily cycle. It cross-checks BC Housing licence, WCB clearance, and liability insurance against provincial registries. The output is a live, embeddable Trust Badge with a real-time score and verified credential stack.</p>
<p>A homeowner spending $15,000 on a roof reads every review they can find before they call. If your five-star Google reviews are buried under one angry Yelp post from 2019, you lose the job — and you never know why.</p>

</section>
<section id="how-eyespyr-com-changes-the-equation">
<h2>How eyespyr.com changes the equation</h2>
<p>Enter your business name and social handles. EyeSpyR scrapes, verifies, and scores inside 24 hours. The Trust Badge embeds on your IAM listing, your website, your email signature, and your Google Business Profile. It refreshes automatically every 24 hours — no manual upkeep, ever.</p>

</section>
<section id="the-10-territory-model">
<h2>The $10 territory model</h2>
<p>Industry Army Marketing keeps the offer simple: $10 placements, dofollow pages, direct lead routing, and no inflated retainer layer. The constraint is scarcity — the best city-plus-trade and partner placements are limited by design.</p>

</section>
<section id="faqs"><h2>Frequently asked: Trust Engine in Canada</h2><h3>What does EyeSpyR verify?</h3><p>Licence (BC Housing, equivalent provincial registries), WCB clearance, liability insurance, and aggregated reviews across Google, HomeAdvisor, Houzz, Yelp, Facebook, and BBB.</p>
<h3>Is it really free?</h3><p>Yes — free with every IAM monthly territory lock. Standalone EyeSpyR access is also $10/month under The 250 Scale.</p>
<h3>How often does the Trust Badge update?</h3><p>Every 24 hours. New reviews, expired insurance, lapsed WCB — all surface within a day.</p>
<h3>Where can I display the badge?</h3><p>Your IAM listing, your own website, email signature, Google Business Profile, and printed marketing. It is a single embed snippet.</p>
<h3>What if my review profile is weak?</h3><p>EyeSpyR ships with a review-request workflow that triggers post-job. Most contractors double their public review count inside 90 days.</p>
<h3>Where is master pricing?</h3><p>All IAM platform pricing follows The 250 Scale — industryarmymarketing.com/pricing.</p></section>


